    "lawCode": "Amd §1210, Tax L",
    "lawSection": "Tax Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S5553\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\nAn act to amend the tax law, in relation to the imposition of sales\nand compensating use taxes by the county of Monroe\n\n\n PURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL :\nExtends authority of Monroe County to impose certain sales and\ncompensating use tax through November 30, 2011.\n\n SUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS :\nAmends sections 1210, 1262 and 1262-g of the tax law to extend\nauthorization of Monroe County to impose sales and compensating use\ntax and the distribution of such to November 30, 2011.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\nCurrent authorization was set to expire November 30, 2009.\n\n PRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\nS.6000/A.7679 of 2007\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nTo be determined.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nEffective immediately.\n",
